message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Recall: An AI With a Photographic Memory of Your World"
authors:
  - family-names: "Syed"
    given-names: "Zaid Ali"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4313-1510"
date-released: 2026-06-16
url: "https://github.com/zaidwhy/recall"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zaidwhy/recall"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Point your phone camera at your space, ask out loud where you left
  something, and get a spoken answer with the exact frame it saw it in.
  Built on Gemini Live, Gemini Flash, and a local ChromaDB vector store.
